rd for Cumberland County runs 75 years from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids February to March came in under 90% of normal in 37 of them. In 2025 the middle of the grids ran 154% of normal in February to March and 66% of normal in July to August. In 2026 so far it sits at 48% of normal for March to April and 115% for June to July. Grid 20280 had its driest year in 1980 at 68% of normal.</p>"}
